                "2. How to Make a Chain Stitch (ch): Hold the slip knot base with your non-hook thumb. Wrap working yarn over the hook from back to front (yarn over, abbreviated yo). Rotate the hook mouth slightly downward and pull the yarn through the loop on your hook. One chain complete. Repeat to form your foundation chain.",
